{"id":"0f512a86c5f28b45","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-prefix-concatenation.md","title":"Prefix-Free Pair and Concatenation Bounds","display":"thm-prefix-concatenation — Prefix-Free Pair and Concatenation Bounds","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-prefix-concatenation","aliases":["43-thm-prefix-concatenation"],"display":"thm-prefix-concatenation — Prefix-Free Pair and Concatenation Bounds","depends_on":["[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","[[43-df-pair-coding]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Lemma 6.7.6","source_printed_pages":"104","source_pdf_pages":"124","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-prefix-concatenation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-prefix-concatenation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-prefix-concatenation — Prefix-Free Pair and Concatenation Bounds"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e039afac1517f3d7\" href=\"?note=e039afac1517f3d7\" title=\"43-df-pair-coding\">43-df-pair-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Lemma 6.7.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"104"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"124"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>；自然数参数按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e039afac1517f3d7\" href=\"?note=e039afac1517f3d7\" title=\"43-df-pair-coding\">43-df-pair-coding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}\\)</span> 编码。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\tau\">\\(\\sigma\\tau\\)</span> 是串连接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(K(\\sigma\\tau)\\le K(\\sigma,\\tau)+c\\land K(\\sigma,\\tau)\\le K(\\sigma)+K(\\tau)+c\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(K(\\sigma\\tau)\\le K(\\sigma,\\tau)+c\\land K(\\sigma,\\tau)\\le K(\\sigma)+K(\\tau)+c\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两个自定界程序可以顺序解析。第一式由可计算的配对解码与连接得到。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Lemma 6.7.6；印刷页 104，PDF 页 124。本次逐项核对陈述；下文给出笔记内论证，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pair-coding","status":"resolved","id":"e039afac1517f3d7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pair-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 的 $K$；自然数参数按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码。 $\\sigma\\tau$ 是串连接。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pair-coding","status":"resolved","id":"e039afac1517f3d7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 的 $K$；自然数参数按 [[43-df-pair-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码。 $\\sigma\\tau$ 是串连接。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left(K(\\sigma\\tau)\\le K(\\sigma,\\tau)+c\\land K(\\sigma,\\tau)\\le K(\\sigma)+K(\\tau)+c\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1309,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-136","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-prefix-concatenation]] — Prefix-Free Pair and Concatenation Bounds"}],"outgoing":["6cd902d852c2c848","e039afac1517f3d7"]}